    "bbox": [
      130.08,
      69.52,
      529.56,
      86.33
    ],
    "text": "\"Whether the deprival of pension rights by the Peoples' Bank to Mr.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
