      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.608797073364258,
      12.626422882080078,
      12.846881866455078
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      129.73,
      159.28,
      530.72,
      176.09
    ],
    "text": "in the said bank and while remaining two more years for his pension",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.613243103027344,
      12.66353988647461,
      12.693106651306152,
      12.79996395111084
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      129.7,
      189.04,
      463.56,
      205.85
    ],
    "text": "entitlement is justified and if not, to what relief he is entitled\".",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.608797073364258,
      12.72265338897705,
      12.79420280456543
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.3,
      249.28,
      530.99,
      266.09
    ],
    "text": "After an inquiry the learned arbitrator by his award dated 08.04.2009 held that",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.654631614685059,
      12.671944618225098,
      12.687694549560547
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.05,
      279.53,
      530.6,
      296.34
    ],
    "text": "the Petitioner is not entitled for his pension. The Petitioner in this application",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.66353988647461,
      12.676716804504395
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.07,
      309.28,
      530.03,
      326.09
    ],
    "text": "has sought a writ of certiorari to quash the said award on the basis that the 2nd",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.329657554626465,
      12.600000381469727,
      12.628816604614258,
      12.660505294799805,
      12.73289966583252,
      12.82479476928711
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.02,
      339.53,
      529.99,
      356.34
    ],
    "text": "Respondent has misunderstood or misinterpreted the evidence placed before",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.82,
      369.53,
      530.08,
      386.34
    ],
    "text": "him specifically the provisions of the constitution in relation to the Pensions",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.66353988647461
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.37,
      399.76,
      285.28,
      416.57
    ],
    "text": "Scheme of the 1st Respondent Bank.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.899999618530273,
      12.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.48,
      460.25,
      529.56,
      477.06
    ],
    "text": "The 1st Respondent's Pension Scheme has laid down rules for the entitlement to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.899999618530273,
      12.600000381469727,
      12.798684120178223
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      490.25,
      530.33,
      507.06
    ],
    "text": "the said scheme. Rule 1.1 of the Pension Rules provides that the employee who",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.578181266784668,
      12.600000381469727,
      12.647759437561035
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.47,
      520.48,
      530.17,
      537.29
    ],
    "text": "are qualified for the pension are those who have reached the age of retirement of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.70382308959961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.43,
      550.72,
      529.8,
      567.53
    ],
    "text": "55 years and possess over 10 years of service in the 1st Respondent Bank. This",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.899999618530273,
      12.487750053405762,
      12.600000381469727,
      12.66353988647461,
      12.79996395111084
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.53,
      580.96,
      530.27,
      597.77
    ],
    "text": "Rule was considered and interpreted in the case of People's Bank v Gilbert",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.66353988647461,
      12.87685775756836
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.32,
      611.2,
      508.5,
      628.01
    ],
    "text": "Weerasinghe (2008) BLR Vol. XIV at page 133 where the Supreme Court held:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.43537425994873,
      12.460073471069336,
      12.600000381469727,
      12.655826568603516,
      12.781394004821777
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      128.69,
      641.44,
      529.8,
      658.27
    ],
    "text": "\"It must be noted that the Pension rights are not automatically accrued to",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.65567684173584,
      12.676716804504395,
      12.72027587890625,
      12.734383583068848,
      12.887847900390625
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      128.75,
      671.44,
      529.57,
      688.25
    ],
    "text": "an employee. There are specific criteria to be fulfilled for an employee to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.600000381469727,
      12.775725364685059,
      12.89568042755127
    ]
